Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:01:01.00,Default,,0,0,8,,《霍比特人》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.52,0:01:15.22,Default,,0,0,8,,(布里 夏尔边境)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:44.79,Default,,0,0,8,,(跃马旅店)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:48.70,Default,,0,0,8,,(12个月后)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.91,0:06:39.21,Default,,0,0,8,,《史矛革之战》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.68,0:10:27.69,Default,,0,0,8,,现在就进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.39,0:10:31.11,Default,,0,0,8,,趁矮人渣滓睡着时杀光他们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.11,0:10:33.32,Default,,0,0,8,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.11,0:10:38.20,Default,,0,0,8,,那头野兽在站岗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.66,0:10:47.83,Default,,0,0,8,,我们要在半路上截杀他们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.34,0:11:02.39,Default,,0,0,8,,大军正在多尔戈多集结
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.01,0:11:06.81,Default,,0,0,8,,主人召见你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:52.98,Default,,0,0,8,,我们人数日渐增长
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.29,0:12:56.00,Default,,0,0,8,,力量日渐增强
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.29,0:12:58.71,Default,,0,0,8,,你来统领军队吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.30,0:13:01.70,Default,,0,0,8,,橡木盾怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.43,0:13:08.34,Default,,0,0,8,,战火将至
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.54,0:13:10.48,Default,,0,0,8,,你说我可以取他的人头
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.58,0:13:13.51,Default,,0,0,8,,凡人终有一死
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.33,0:13:20.69,Default,,0,0,8,,还要追杀他们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.03,0:13:26.49,Default,,0,0,8,,博格
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.24,0:13:42.63,Default,,0,0,8,,我有任务给你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.84,0:13:47.38,Default,,0,0,8,,还想喝矮人的血吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.05,0:33:23.49,Default,,0,0,8,,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.48,0:33:31.65,Default,,0,0,8,,蜘蛛都死了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.11,0:33:34.38,Default,,0,0,8,,是的 但还会有的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.70,0:33:37.49,Default,,0,0,8,,它们越来越放肆了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.79,0:33:48.09,Default,,0,0,8,,这是上古精灵宝剑
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.63,0:33:53.13,Default,,0,0,8,,我的族人打造的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.83,0:34:26.08,Default,,0,0,8,,关上大门
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.33,0:35:48.54,Default,,0,0,8,,那矮人为什么盯着你看 塔睿尔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.54,0:35:50.66,Default,,0,0,8,,谁知道
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.85,0:35:54.42,Default,,0,0,8,,他倒是个挺高的矮人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.22,0:35:56.32,Default,,0,0,8,,你说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.45,0:35:58.29,Default,,0,0,8,,是比一般的矮人高
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.42,0:36:01.09,Default,,0,0,8,,但还是一样丑
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.54,0:41:21.70,Default,,0,0,8,,门口有人守卫
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.95,0:41:24.92,Default,,0,0,8,,他们人数不足 跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.01,0:48:38.55,Default,,0,0,8,,关闸门
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.15,0:49:32.62,Default,,0,0,8,,全杀光
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.22,0:50:39.59,Default,,0,0,8,,杀了她 杀了那个母精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.12,0:51:08.72,Default,,0,0,8,,追上他们
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.46,0:54:43.06,Default,,0,0,8,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.99,0:54:47.72,Default,,0,0,8,,不要杀他
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.76,0:54:52.70,Default,,0,0,8,,追上去 拦住他们
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.42,1:03:03.17,Default,,0,0,8,,狗没有权利问我问题 母精灵
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.06,1:03:16.22,Default,,0,0,8,,够了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.59,1:03:18.43,Default,,0,0,8,,塔睿尔 走开
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.96,1:03:20.23,Default,,0,0,8,,马上
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.83,1:05:07.40,Default,,0,0,8,,关闭城门
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.70,1:05:10.97,Default,,0,0,8,,国王下令封城
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.61,1:05:12.84,Default,,0,0,8,,那塔睿尔怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.54,1:05:16.98,Default,,0,0,8,,她怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.14,1:05:18.45,Default,,0,0,8,,她带着弓箭和匕首
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.35,1:05:21.21,Default,,0,0,8,,跑进森林里去了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.62,1:05:23.22,Default,,0,0,8,,还没有回来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.84,1:05:48.84,Default,,0,0,8,,矮人的血
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.08,1:05:50.38,Default,,0,0,8,,他们经过这里
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.84,1:05:53.68,Default,,0,0,8,,还有另一股味道
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.48,1:05:59.29,Default,,0,0,8,,是人肉
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.36,1:06:06.36,Default,,0,0,8,,他们找到渡湖的方法了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.37,1:19:35.20,Default,,0,0,8,,我还当你是兽人
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.54,1:19:37.20,Default,,0,0,8,,如果我是兽人
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.50,1:19:38.74,Default,,0,0,8,,你早就死了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.98,1:20:04.36,Default,,0,0,8,,跟我回去
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.36,1:20:06.11,Default,,0,0,8,,他会原谅你的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.25,1:20:07.75,Default,,0,0,8,,但我不会
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.88,1:20:10.82,Default,,0,0,8,,如果跟你回去 我不会原谅自己
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.62,1:32:48.19,Default,,0,0,8,,藏身于此的恶灵
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.96,1:32:51.56,Default,,0,0,8,,速速现身
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.49,1:32:55.33,Default,,0,0,8,,现出原形
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.00,1:33:19.49,Default,,0,0,8,,巫师来了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.72,1:33:21.76,Default,,0,0,8,,他在施咒
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.92,1:33:23.36,Default,,0,0,8,,他会找到我们的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.76,1:33:26.70,Default,,0,0,8,,那就让他找
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.69,1:42:13.40,Default,,0,0,8,,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.72,1:45:01.06,Default,,0,0,8,,你来晚了 巫师
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.72,1:45:03.76,Default,,0,0,8,,来不及了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.91,1:45:13.74,Default,,0,0,8,,他无所不在
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.66,1:45:17.41,Default,,0,0,8,,我们是兽人军团
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.69,1:45:32.84,Default,,0,0,8,,已经结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.69,1:45:40.06,Default,,0,0,8,,追上他
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.85,1:46:00.15,Default,,0,0,8,,巫师 光明是不可能
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.95,1:46:05.59,Default,,0,0,8,,对抗黑暗的
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.90,2:06:43.27,Default,,0,0,8,,橡木盾跑了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:44.20,2:06:45.29,Default,,0,0,8,,撤退
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.57,2:06:47.07,Default,,0,0,8,,桥上会合
Dialogue: 0,2:16:26.03,2:16:28.66,Default,,0,0,8,,给多尔戈多送信
Dialogue: 0,2:16:29.03,2:16:31.80,Default,,0,0,8,,橡木盾到了孤山
Dialogue: 0,2:16:42.63,2:16:43.60,Default,,0,0,8,,快去
Dialogue: 0,2:16:44.28,2:16:46.45,Default,,0,0,8,,你 跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.27,0:02:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小心点 - 抱歉 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watch it! - Sorry, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.93,0:02:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here you are. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.78,0:02:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以坐这吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind if I join you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.47,0:02:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,和他的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.05,0:02:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,自我介绍下 我叫甘道夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should introduce myself. My name is Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.23,0:03:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,灰袍巫师甘道夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf the Grey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.07,0:03:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.92,0:03:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,碰到你真巧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now, this is a fine chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.30,0:03:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,什么风把索林·橡木盾吹来了布里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What brings Thorin Oakenshield to Bree?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.87,0:03:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我收到消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I receive words{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.10,0:03:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,有人看到我父亲在登兰德荒野游荡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that my father have been seen wandering in the wilds near Dunland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.01,0:03:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我去找过 但一无所获\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went looking, found no sign of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.08,0:03:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,索林 很久以来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin, it's been a long time since anything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.13,0:03:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,瑟莱因的消息都只是谣言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but rumor was heard of Thrain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他还活着 我敢保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He still lives, I am sure of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.30,0:03:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲失踪前拜访过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father came to see you before he went missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.87,0:03:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你对他说了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you say to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.40,0:03:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我敦促他进军艾雷博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I urged him to march upon Erebor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,集合矮人的七支大军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To gather the seven armies of dwarves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.19,0:03:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,消灭恶龙 收复孤山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To destroy the dragon and take back the Lonely Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.41,0:04:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要同样敦促你 去收复家园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I would say the same to you, take back your homeland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.35,0:04:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是碰巧遇到我吧 甘道夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is no chance meeting, is it, Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.64,0:04:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.52,0:04:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,孤山一直困扰着我 索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Lonely Mountain troubles me, Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.37,0:04:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,恶龙盘踞得太久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That dragon has sat there long enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,会引来更加邪恶的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sooner or later, darker minds will turn towards Erebor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.93,0:04:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我顺绿色大道南下时 遇到了些讨厌的生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ran into some unsavory characters whilst travelling along Greenway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.19,0:04:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,把我当成了流浪汉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They mistook me for a vagabond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.96,0:04:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们肯定后悔了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I imagine they regreted that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.59,0:04:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他们还带了个信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of them was carrying a message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这是黑语言(魔多语)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is Black Speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.23,0:04:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是悬赏 - 悬赏什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He promised as payment. - For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你的人头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.46,0:04:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有人想要你死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone wants you dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.76,0:04:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,索林 你不能再等了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin, you could wait no longer,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.46,0:04:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你是杜林王座的继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are the heir to the throne of Durin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.47,0:05:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,召集矮人军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unite the armies of the Dwarves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.68,0:05:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,齐心协力 去夺回艾雷博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together you have the might and power to retake Erebor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.22,0:05:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,召集七大矮人家族的会议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Summon a meeting of the seven Dwarf families,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,要求他们信守誓言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}demand they stand by their oath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.77,0:05:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,七大家族的军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Seven Armies sworn an oath to the one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,只效忠手握阿肯宝钻的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who wields the King's Jewel, the Arkenstone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.51,0:05:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,只有帝王珍宝才能联合他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the only thing that will unite them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.36,0:05:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 那宝石已经被史矛革偷走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and in case you have forgotten, that jewel was stolen by Smaug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.29,0:05:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我帮助你找回它呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I were to help you reclaim it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.63,0:05:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么找 宝石远在半个中土世界之外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How? The Arkenstone lies half a world away,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.31,0:05:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,在那只火龙的魔掌中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}buried beneath the feet of a fire-breathing dragon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.86,0:05:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们需要一个盗贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is why we're going to need a burglar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.93,0:06:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 半兽人狼群有多远 - 非常近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How close is the pack? - Too close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.23,0:06:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,只有几里格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couple of leagues, no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.01,0:06:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,但还有更要命的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that's not the worst of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.10,0:06:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会嗅到我们的气味的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will smell us, pick our scent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.42,0:06:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,现在还没 不过迟早会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet but they will do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有别的麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have another problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.95,0:06:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他们看见你了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did they see you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.37,0:06:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看见了你吗 - 不 不是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They saw you? - No. That's not it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.43,0:06:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么说的 安静得像只老鼠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did I tell you? Quiet as a mouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.43,0:07:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,天生是块盗贼的料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent burglar material.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.99,0:07:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 都听我说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you listen? Will you just listen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.78,0:07:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我要说的是 外面还有其他东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to tell you there is something else out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.32,0:07:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,它什么样子 像头熊吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What form did it take, like a bear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.03,0:07:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,对 但更大 大得多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but bigger, much bigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.45,0:07:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识那野兽吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew about this beast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得应该原路返回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say we double back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.02,0:07:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那会被兽人追上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will be run down by a pack of wolves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.56,0:07:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,有栋房子 离这不远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a house, it's not far from here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.95,0:07:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可供我们躲避\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where we might take refuge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.15,0:07:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,谁的房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whose house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.64,0:07:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是敌是友 - 都不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A friend or foe? - Neither.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他也许会帮助我们 也许会杀了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will help us, or, he will kill us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.34,0:07:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有其他选择吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What choice do we have?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.62,0:07:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这边 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.82,0:08:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.63,0:08:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.44,0:08:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,进房子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the house!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.65,0:08:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.82,0:08:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, get inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,打开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.19,0:08:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.95,0:09:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,用力推\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Push!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.79,0:09:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.26,0:09:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.48,0:09:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的房主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is our host.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.58,0:09:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫贝荣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is Beorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个变形人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he's a skin-changer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.87,0:09:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有时是头壮硕的黑熊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes he's a huge black bear,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.23,0:09:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,有时是个高大强壮的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sometimes he's a great strong man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.85,0:09:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,黑熊喜怒无常 但变成人 他还是讲道理的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bear is unpredictable, but the man can be reasoned with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.82,0:09:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 他不太喜欢矮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, he's not over fond of Dwarves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.81,0:09:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他走了 - 离门远一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's leaving. - Come away from there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.48,0:09:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,它不正常 这都不正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not natural, none of it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.22,0:09:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定被黑魔法控制了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's obvious, he's under some dark spell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.57,0:09:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,别犯傻 那是他自己的变形术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be a fool. He's under no enchantment but his own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:10:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 现在 大家休息吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, now. Get some sleep, all of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.02,0:10:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚你们在这儿是安全的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be safe here tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.27,0:12:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,至尊戒 驭众戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ash nazg durbatuluk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.23,0:12:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,至尊戒 寻众戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ash nazg gimbatul{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.45,0:12:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,至尊魔戒引众戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ash nazg thrakatuluk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.86,0:12:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,黑暗之中锁众戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agh burzum-ishi krimpatul{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.58,0:14:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是那个橡木盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you are the one they call Oakenshield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.93,0:15:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我 为什么亵渎者阿佐格要追杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, why is Azorg the Defiler hunting you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.59,0:15:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识阿佐格 怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know of Azorg. How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.01,0:15:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我的族人最先在山中定居\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My people were the first to live in the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.52,0:15:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,远在兽人南下之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before the Orcs came down from the north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.42,0:15:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,亵渎者几乎杀光了我的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Defiler killed most of my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.19,0:15:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,只留了几个做奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But some he enslaved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.82,0:15:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不是做苦力 明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not for work, you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.51,0:15:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是为了娱乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But for sport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.54,0:15:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他似乎觉得折磨变形人是种消遣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caging skin-changers and torturing them seemed to amuse him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.08,0:15:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,还有像你这样的人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are others like you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.23,0:15:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经有很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once there were many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.87,0:15:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,现在呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.29,0:15:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,只剩一个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now there's only one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.73,0:15:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要在秋天结束前抵达孤山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to reach the mountain before the last days of autumn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.36,0:15:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,对 在杜林之日前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before Durin's Day falls, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你们没多少时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're running out of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.58,0:15:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们必须穿过黑森林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is why we must go through Mirkwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.12,0:15:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,有阴影笼罩着黑森林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A darkness lies upon that forest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.18,0:16:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,邪恶在林间滋生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Foul things creep beneath those trees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.20,0:16:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,墨瑞亚的兽人和多尔戈多的亡灵法师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is an alliance between the Orcs of Moria{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.09,0:16:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,结成了同盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the Necromancer in Dol Guldur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.29,0:16:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会冒险去那里 除非迫不得已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would not venture there, except in great need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.34,0:16:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走精灵之路 那里再安全不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will take the Elven road. That path is too safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.20,0:16:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Safe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.54,0:16:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,木精灵与其他精灵不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Wood-elves in Mirkwood are not like their kin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.67,0:16:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他们没那么睿智 却更加危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're less wise and more dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.76,0:16:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但这不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it matters not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.29,0:16:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.45,0:16:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这片土地到处都是兽人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These lands are crawling with Orcs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.11,0:16:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的数量越来越多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their numbers are growing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.01,0:16:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你们徒步前行 永远到不了森林的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're on foot, you will never reach the forest alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.14,0:16:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢矮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like Dwarves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.47,0:16:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他们贪婪又盲目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are greedy, and blind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.64,0:16:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧不起他们眼中的劣等生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blind to the lives of those they deem lesser than their own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.57,0:17:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,但我更恨兽人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Orcs I hate more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.62,0:17:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你们需要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you need?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.34,0:17:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,快走吧 趁着天色还早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go now, while you have the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.01,0:17:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,追杀你们的人就在后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your hunters are not far behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.35,0:17:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,精灵之门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Elven Gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.74,0:17:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是去往黑森林的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here lies our path through Mirkwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.85,0:17:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没有兽人的踪迹 算我们走运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sign of the Orcs. We have luck on our side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.51,0:18:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,把马匹放走 让它们去找主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set the ponies loose. Let them return to their master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.61,0:18:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这座森林好像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This forest feels...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.58,0:18:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,病了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.44,0:18:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,像是被疾病困扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As if there's a disease lies upon it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.09,0:18:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,没有其他路可走了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there no way around?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.94,0:18:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,除非往北走200英里 或往南走...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not unless we go to 200 miles north, or twice that distance...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.76,0:18:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,400英里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.15,0:18:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,阴影中有股力量蠢蠢欲动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something moves in the shadows unseen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.65,0:19:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,躲避我们的耳目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hidden from our sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.01,0:19:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,它的力量日渐强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every day it grows in strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.40,0:19:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,小心那个亡灵法师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beware the Necromancer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.40,0:19:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他可不简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not what he seems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.80,0:19:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,如果敌人归来了 一定要通知我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If our enemy has returned, we must know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.52,0:19:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,快去山中的戒灵坟墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to the tombs in the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.33,0:19:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,高丘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The High Fells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.41,0:19:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So be it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.11,0:19:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我还要骑马 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not my horse, I need it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.07,0:19:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是要离开吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not leaving us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.30,0:19:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是迫不得已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not do this unless I had to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.93,0:19:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你变了 比尔博·巴金斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've changed. Bilbo Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.48,0:19:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不是离开夏尔时的那个霍比特了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And not the same Hobbit as the one who left Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.71,0:20:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来想告诉你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was going to tell you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.88,0:20:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我在半兽人的隧道里发现了一样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found something in the Goblin Tunnels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.08,0:20:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Found what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.41,0:20:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你发现了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you find?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.63,0:20:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我的勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My courage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.59,0:20:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Well that's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.57,0:20:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.64,0:20:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我在艾雷博山前的瞭望角等你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be waiting for you at the overlook before the slopes of Erebor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.81,0:20:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,小心保管地图和钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep the map and key safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.55,0:20:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不要擅自进入孤山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not enter the Mountain without me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.47,0:20:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不是绿林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not the Greenwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.20,0:20:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,森林的空气中充斥着幻象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Although the very air of the forest is heavy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.05,0:21:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,侵蚀你们的意志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with illusion that'll see to enter your mind...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.19,0:21:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,引你们误入歧途\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and lead you astray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.63,0:21:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,误入歧途\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lead us astray?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.68,0:21:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.47,0:21:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,必须沿着路走 不要离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must stay on the path, do not leave it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.07,0:21:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,否则就再也找不到路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you do, you'll never find it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.30,0:21:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不管发生什么 务必沿着路走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter what may come, stay on the path!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.85,0:21:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 要在杜林之日的日落前赶到孤山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, we must reach the mountain before the sunset on Durin's Day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.99,0:21:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,杜林之日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Durin's Day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.78,0:21:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走吧 - 我们只有一次机会找到隐秘之门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go. - We have one chance to find the hidden door .{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.92,0:21:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,路往这边拐了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The path goes this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.72,0:22:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.48,0:22:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,空气 我需要空气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Air. I need air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.88,0:22:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我的脑袋在打转 怎回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My head, it's spinning. What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.40,0:22:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 继续走 - 诺瑞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're moving. - Nori.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.78,0:22:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么停下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why have we stopped?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.93,0:22:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,路径消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The path, it's disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.05,0:22:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.83,0:22:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,路不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've lost the path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.95,0:22:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那就找 大家一起找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find it. All of you, look! Look for the path!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.82,0:22:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我不记得这地方 从来没见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't remember this place, none of it is familiar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.68,0:22:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.30,0:22:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 我们连这是哪都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do not know. We do not even know what it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.58,0:23:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,看 烟草袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, a tobacco pouch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.55,0:23:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这森林里有矮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's Dwarves in these woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.37,0:23:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,而且还是蓝山的矮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dwarves in the Blue Mountains no less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.05,0:23:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这和我的烟草袋一模一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is exactly the same as mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.10,0:23:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,因为就是你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it is yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.55,0:24:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗 我们在绕圈子 我们迷路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand? We are going round in circles, we are lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.14,0:24:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有迷路 我们在往东走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not lost, we keep heading east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.95,0:24:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但哪面是东\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But which way is the east?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.26,0:24:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们看不见太阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've lost the sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.76,0:24:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳 要找到太阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sun, we have to find the sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.62,0:24:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,在上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.24,0:24:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.72,0:24:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,够了 都给我安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough! Quiet, all of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.61,0:24:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在盯着我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're being watched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.10,0:25:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见了湖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, I can see a lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.33,0:25:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,和一条河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a river,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.83,0:25:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,还有孤山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the Lonely Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.28,0:25:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're almost there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.01,0:25:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你们能听见吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.61,0:25:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know which way to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.06,0:25:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.55,0:25:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.38,0:26:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不 别啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.34,0:27:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧吃 都跑不掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat them now, none is running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.54,0:27:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他的皮很硬 里面肯定多汁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His hide is tough, this could be juicy inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.44,0:27:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finish it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.96,0:28:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他还活着 你没杀掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's alive, you didn't kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.75,0:28:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.27,0:28:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,开吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.96,0:28:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,开吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.77,0:28:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.72,0:28:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不欺负你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fair terms, you see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.30,0:28:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,只尝一小口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a little taste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.61,0:28:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,什么东西 在哪儿 在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it? Where is it? Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.34,0:28:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.94,0:28:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,刺到我了 疼死我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It stings, stings!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.26,0:29:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,刺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.55,0:29:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这名字不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a good name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.66,0:29:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,刺叮剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.03,0:29:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我没事 - 比尔博在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm all right. - Where's Bilbo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.62,0:29:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 比尔博 - 我在上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bilbo. - I'm up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.21,0:30:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haul!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.25,0:30:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪儿 到哪儿去了 掉哪儿去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it? Where is it? Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.57,0:30:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.12,0:30:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,格罗因 奇力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gloin! Kili!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.75,0:30:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,杀光它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill them all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.39,0:30:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,奇力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kili!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.11,0:31:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.23,0:31:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,快 跟上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, keep up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.71,0:32:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,别以为我不会下杀手 矮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not think I will not kill you, Dwarf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.26,0:32:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我乐意之极\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be my pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.68,0:32:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 奇力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! - Kili!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.59,0:32:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的匕首扔给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw me your dagger!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.39,0:32:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.01,0:32:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我会给你武器吗 矮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you think I'm giving you a weapon, Dwarf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.04,0:32:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你想错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're mistaken!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.24,0:33:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,搜身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Search them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.13,0:33:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,还给我 这是私人物品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, give it back, that's private!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.63,0:33:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这是谁 你的弟弟吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this? your brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.24,0:33:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我老婆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is my wife!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.31,0:33:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这长得像半兽人的是谁 这么丑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what is this horrid creature, a Goblin-mutant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.05,0:33:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我家儿子 金雳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my wee lad, Gimli!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.92,0:33:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你从哪得到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you get this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.74,0:33:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,别人送的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was given to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.41,0:34:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不但是个贼 还是个骗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not just a thief but a liar as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.83,0:34:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,带他们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enwenno hain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.12,0:34:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,索林 比尔博去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin, where's Bilbo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.41,0:35:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你们没完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not the end of it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.95,0:35:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你不来搜我的身吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you going to search me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.23,0:35:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我裤裆里可能什么都有哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could have anything down my trousers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.20,0:35:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,或是什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.75,0:36:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.49,0:36:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,逃不出去的 这不是半兽人的地牢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no way out, this is no Orc dungeon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.13,0:36:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是林地王国的牢房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are holes of the Woodland Realm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.87,0:36:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,没有国王的恩准 谁也不出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one leaves here but by the King's consent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.32,0:36:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有人觉得这是什么崇高的使命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some imagine that a noble quest is at hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.74,0:36:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,收复家园 消灭恶龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A quest to reclaim a homeland, and slay a dragon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.78,0:36:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但我觉得你们没有这么高尚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I myself suspect a more prosiac motive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.62,0:36:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你们只能干偷鸡摸狗的勾当\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attempted burglary or something of that ilk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.50,0:36:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你找到了进山的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have found a way in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.77,0:36:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你在找能赋予你王权的宝物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seek that which would bestow upon you, the right to rule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.60,0:37:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,帝王珍宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The King's Jewel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.38,0:37:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,阿肯宝钻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Arkenstone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.25,0:37:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在你眼中是无价之宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is precious to you beyond measure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.51,0:37:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我能够理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.17,0:37:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,山中众多宝石 我也觊觎已久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The gems in the Mountain that I, too, desire...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.13,0:37:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,白色的宝石 如同纯洁的星光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}White gems, a pure starlight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.46,0:37:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I offer you my help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.99,0:37:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,请说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.49,0:37:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我会放你们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would let you go,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.28,0:37:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但要把我的财宝还给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you but return what is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.05,0:37:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,公平交换\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A favor for a favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.71,0:37:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,王者之间的约定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have my word, one king to another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.77,0:37:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕世界毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would not trust Thranduil,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.45,0:37:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不会相信瑟兰迪尔 这位国王的承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a great king to honor his words till the end of all days be upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.58,0:38:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你不值得信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lack all honor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.10,0:38:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到过你怎样对待盟友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen how you treat your friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.80,0:38:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们找到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We came to you once,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.08,0:38:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,饥肠辘辘 无家可归 渴求你的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}starving, homeless , seeking your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.69,0:38:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你却袖手旁观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you turned your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.35,0:38:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你转身离去 让我的人民饱受煎熬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You turned away from the suffering of my people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.24,0:38:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,面对毁灭家园的地狱之火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The inferno that destroyed us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.64,0:38:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,葬身火海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imrid amrad ursul!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.71,0:38:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不要跟我说龙火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not talk to me of dragon fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.31,0:38:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我体会过它的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know its wrath and ruin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.52,0:38:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我也斗过北方的恶龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have faced the great serpents of the north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.11,0:38:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我警告过你的祖父 他的贪婪必会引来恶果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I warned your grandfather of what his greed would summon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.76,0:38:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但他充耳不闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he would not listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.20,0:38:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你和他一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are just like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.84,0:38:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里待到尸骨无存吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay here if you will, and rot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.34,0:39:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,100年对精灵来说 只是一瞬间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}100 years is a mere blink in the life of an Elf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.87,0:39:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我有的是耐心 我会等的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am patient. I can wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.24,0:39:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他向你提条件了吗 - 提了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did he offer you a deal? - He did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.37,0:39:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我唾弃了他的先祖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told him he can go ish kakhfê ai'd dur rugnu!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.41,0:39:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,还有他的族人们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Him and all his kin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.77,0:39:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's that, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.70,0:39:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我们唯一的希望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The deal was our only hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.78,0:39:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,还不是唯一的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not our only hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.29,0:39:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.63,0:39:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要在阴影中徘徊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you linger in the shadows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.77,0:39:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来向您报告的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was coming to report to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.13,0:39:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我两日前就下令要你摧毁那个巢穴了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I ordered that nest to be destroyed not 2 moons past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.80,0:40:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,森林已经扫荡过了 主上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cleared the forest as ordered, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.25,0:40:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但还有蜘蛛不断从南边涌入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But more spiders keep coming up from the south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.74,0:40:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在多尔戈多的废墟中繁殖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are spawning in the ruins of Dol Guldur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.59,0:40:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能从源头上扼制住他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we could kill them at their source...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.35,0:40:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的堡垒远在边界之外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fortress lies beyond our borders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.53,0:40:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,避免邪恶生物侵入我们的领土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep our lands clear of those foul creatures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.47,0:40:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是你的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is your task.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.82,0:40:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就算赶跑了又怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when we drive them off? What then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.52,0:40:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他们难道不会跑到其他地方去吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will they not spread to other lands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.53,0:40:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,其他地方不关我的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Other lands are not my concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.93,0:40:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,外面的世界潮起潮落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fortunes of the world will rise and fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.79,0:40:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我们的国度永在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But here in this kingdom, we will endure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.30,0:40:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,莱戈拉斯说你今天非常英勇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Legolas said you fought well today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.21,0:40:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他对你是渐生好感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's grown very fond of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.97,0:40:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我向您保证 主上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assure you, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.05,0:40:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,在他眼里 我只不过是个卫队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Legolas thinks of me as no more than a captain of the guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.14,0:40:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,也许以前是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps he did once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.11,0:40:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,现在可不一定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I'm not so sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.14,0:41:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我想您不会允许自己的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not think you would allow your son{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.74,0:41:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,对出身卑微的木精灵有好感吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to pledge himself to a lowly Silvan Elf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.48,0:41:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 我不会允许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you're right. I would not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.67,0:41:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,但他还是很在乎你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still, he cares about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.88,0:41:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没有希望 就不要让他幻想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not give him hope where there is none.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.25,0:41:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,（归来吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.79,0:41:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你手里的那枚石头是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stone in your hand, what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.25,0:41:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是个护身符\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a talisman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.97,0:42:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,上面刻着强大的咒语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A powerful spell lies upon it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.72,0:42:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,只要不是矮人 看到咒语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if any but a Dwarf reads the runes on this stone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.57,0:42:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,就会受到永恒的诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will be forever cursed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.88,0:42:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,也没准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.76,0:42:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,信则灵 不信则不灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Depending on whether you believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.78,0:42:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这种东西只是个象征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This kind of thing is just a token.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.39,0:42:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,符文石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A rune stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.17,0:42:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈妈给我的 好让我记得承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother gave it to me so I'd remember my promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.53,0:42:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,什么承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What promise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.47,0:42:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我会回到她身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I would come back to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.67,0:42:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,她很担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She worries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.29,0:42:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,她觉得我很鲁莽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She thinks I'm reckless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.61,0:42:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.65,0:42:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好盛大的宴会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like quite a party having out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.65,0:43:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那是星光盛宴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is mereth en gilith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.00,0:43:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,在星光下的晚宴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The feast of starlight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.18,0:43:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,精灵认为光都是神圣的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All light is sacred to the Eldar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.37,0:43:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但木精灵最爱的是星光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Wood Elves love best for light of the stars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.37,0:43:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直觉得星光是清冷的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always thought it is a cold light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.04,0:43:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,遥不可及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remote and far away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.62,0:43:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那是回忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.41,0:43:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,纯洁宝贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precious and pure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.98,0:43:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,像你的承诺一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like your promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.73,0:43:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我上去过几次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have walked there sometimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.77,0:43:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,森林上面 深入夜色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond the forest and up into the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.88,0:43:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,远远地看着整个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have seen the world full away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.11,0:43:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,夜空中充满了白色的光辉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the white light forever fill the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.31,0:44:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我见过一次焰月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw fire moon once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.06,0:44:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,在登兰德附近的路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The roads of the path near Dunland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.94,0:44:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,巨大的月亮 火红金灿的光芒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huge, red and golden it was, filled the sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.81,0:44:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们当时护送一批梅督林的商人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were an escort for some merchants in Mindolluin,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.05,0:44:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他们用银器换皮毛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they were trading in silver work for furs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.24,0:44:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们沿着绿色大道南下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We took the Greenway south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.45,0:44:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,山一直在我们左侧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keeping the mountain to our left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.56,0:44:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,日暮之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the end of the day,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.68,0:44:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,一轮巨大的焰月 照亮我们的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you see huge fire moon lighting our path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.46,0:44:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的酒快喝完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're running out of drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.88,0:44:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这些空酒桶早就该送回埃加洛斯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These empty barrels should be sent back to Esgaroth hours ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.88,0:44:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,驳船工肯定在等了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bargeman would be waiting for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.21,0:44:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,随你怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say what you like,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.95,0:44:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,咱的臭脾气国王藏的美酒不能放过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the ill-tempered king has this excellent, tasty wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.04,0:44:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来吧 罗斯 尝一下 - 我还要看管矮人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, Ross, try it. - I have the Dwarves in my charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.71,0:44:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,都被锁起来了 还能跑到哪去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're locked up, where can they go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.67,0:44:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我敢打赌就要日出了 肯定快到黎明了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll wager the sun is on the rise. Must be nearly dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.18,0:45:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是不是永远都到不了孤山了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We never gonna reach the mountain, are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.74,0:45:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,关在这里怎么去孤山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not stuck in here, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.90,0:45:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bilbo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.16,0:45:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,附近有卫兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are guards nearby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.95,0:45:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.69,0:45:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你先走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.67,0:45:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 欧瑞 - 不是那边 在下面 跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ori. - Not that way. Down here, follow me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.86,0:46:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.99,0:46:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快来 - 我们居然跑到酒窖来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come. - I don't believe we're in the cellars!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.89,0:46:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该带我们找出去的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're supposed to be leading us out now for the road!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.04,0:46:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我脑子清楚得很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what I'm doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.58,0:46:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.04,0:46:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人 快进酒桶 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone, climb into the barrels, quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.62,0:46:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗 他们会发现我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you mad? They'll find us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.53,0:46:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不会的 我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, they won't. I promise you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.22,0:46:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 一定要相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, please, you must trust me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.06,0:46:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,按他说的做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do as he says.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.79,0:46:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在该干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we do now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.48,0:46:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,屏住呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.39,0:46:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,屏住呼吸 什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold my breath? What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.89,0:47:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙在谁手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is the keeper of the keys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.95,0:47:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎 巴金斯大师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome, Master Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.80,0:47:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 出发了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.74,0:48:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,抓稳了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.78,0:48:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bilbo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.82,0:48:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.84,0:48:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不 救命啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.92,0:48:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.89,0:49:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.68,0:49:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,去桥上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get on to the bridge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.14,0:50:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,奇力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kili?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.23,0:50:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,奇力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kili?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.72,0:51:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,奇力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kili?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.62,0:52:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,诺瑞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nori!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.39,0:52:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,一起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come along!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.52,0:53:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,邦伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bombur!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.24,0:56:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是你啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.60,0:56:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要我来这 甘道夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why am I here, Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.14,0:56:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 瑞达加斯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me, Radagast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.60,0:56:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会无缘无故叫你来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would not have called you here without a good reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.13,0:56:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这里不适合见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not a nice place to meet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.86,0:56:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,的确不适合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. It is not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.49,0:57:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这里都是黑魔法 甘道夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are dark spells, Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.36,0:57:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,怨气很重 古老的黑魔法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old, and full of hate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.24,0:57:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这里埋的是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's buried here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.05,0:57:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,就算他有名字 也早被人遗忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he had name, it's long since been lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.62,0:57:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,人们只会记得他是恶魔的仆从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would have been known only as a servant of evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.05,0:57:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,九个戒灵之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of nine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.91,0:57:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么是现在 甘道夫 我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why now, Gandalf? I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.50,0:57:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,戒灵被召唤到了多尔戈多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ring-wraiths is summoned to Dol Guldur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.04,0:57:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但不可能是亡灵法师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it can not be the Necromancer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.39,0:57:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,人类不可能召唤出这么邪恶的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A human sorcerer could not summon such evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.03,0:57:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谁说他是人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who said it was human?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.83,0:57:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,九个戒灵只效忠一人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Nine only answer to one master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.59,0:57:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有注意到 瑞达加斯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been blind, Radagast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.52,0:57:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人趁我们不备 卷土重来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in our blindness the enemy has returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.97,0:57:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他在召集他的仆从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's summoning his servants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.36,0:58:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,亵渎者阿佐格可不是普通的猎手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Azorg the Defiler is no ordinary hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.53,0:58:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个指挥官 军团指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a commander, a commander of legions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.16,0:58:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人要发动战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The enemy is preparing for war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.73,0:58:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,从东边起 他盯上了孤山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will begin in the east. His mind is set upon that mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.71,0:58:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.49,0:58:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 和其他人汇合 - 甘道夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To rejoin the others. - Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.85,0:58:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是我牵的头 我不能抛弃他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I started this, I can not forsake them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.89,0:58:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们危在旦夕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are in grave danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.43,0:58:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你说的是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If what you say is true...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.50,0:58:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,整个世界都危在旦夕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the world is in grave danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.16,0:58:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他藏在堡垒中积蓄力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The power in that fortress will only grow stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.25,0:58:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我把朋友们抛到一旁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to cast my friends aside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.50,0:58:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还有人追吗 - 我看没有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Anything behind us? - Not that I can see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.75,0:58:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,应该甩掉兽人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we've outrun the Orcs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.48,0:58:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,只能逃一时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not for long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.34,0:58:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这里水流太缓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've lost the current.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.80,0:58:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,大家上岸 来吧 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make for the shore. Come on, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.45,0:59:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.28,0:59:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事 小伤而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine. It's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.98,0:59:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走起来 - 奇力受伤了 腿需要包扎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- On your feet. - Kili's wounded, his leg needs binding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.66,0:59:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,有一队兽人跟在我们后面 得赶紧走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's an Orc pack on our tail. We keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.52,0:59:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 去哪 - 去孤山 我们很近了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To where? - To the mountain, we're so close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.08,0:59:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,中间隔着一座湖呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lake lies between us and that mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.09,0:59:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有办法渡湖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have no way to cross it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.53,0:59:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那我们就绕过去 - 兽人肯定会追上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So then we go arround. - The Orcs'll run us down, as sure as daylight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.15,0:59:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也没有防身的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have no weapon to defend ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.16,0:59:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,快包扎他的腿 给你两分钟时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bind his legs quickly. You have 2 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.41,1:00:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会再手下留情了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it again...and you're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.73,1:00:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 你是从长湖城来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, but, um...you're from Lake-town,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.96,1:00:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我没看错吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I'm not mistaken?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.22,1:00:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那边的驳船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That barge over there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.02,1:00:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有可能租给我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is it available for hire by any chance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.16,1:00:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么觉得我会帮你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes you think I would help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.38,1:00:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,从靴子看 你过的日子挺苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those boots have seen better days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.86,1:00:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,从大衣看也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As has that coat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.09,1:00:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,想必你还要养家糊口吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No doubt you have some hungry mouths to feed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.58,1:00:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,几个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many bearings?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.96,1:00:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,一个男孩两个女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A boy and two girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.03,1:00:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜你妻子肯定是个大美人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your wife, I imagine she's a beauty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.45,1:00:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,对 曾经是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, she was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.19,1:00:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我不是故意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, I didn't mean to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.68,1:00:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,得了 得了 客套个什么劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on. Enough for the niceties!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.60,1:00:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你着什么急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your hurry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.77,1:00:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,关你什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's it to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.49,1:01:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我想知道你们是什么人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would like to know who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.79,1:01:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,又在这里做些什么事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what you are doing in these lands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.80,1:01:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是从蓝山来的商人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are simple merchants from the Blue Mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.86,1:01:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,要去铁丘陵走亲戚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Journeying to see our kin in the Iron Hills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.48,1:01:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你们说是普通商人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simple merchants you say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.94,1:01:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要食物 补给和武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need food, supplies, weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.56,1:01:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你能帮忙吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you help us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.48,1:01:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这些木桶是哪来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know where these barrels came from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.23,1:01:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.35,1:01:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你们和精灵之间发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what business you had with the Elves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.73,1:01:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但我觉得结果不太妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I don't think it ended well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.13,1:01:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,除非城主带路 没有人进得了长湖城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one enters Lake-town but by lead of The Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.31,1:01:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他的收入全靠和林地王国的交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All his wealth comes from trades with the Woodland Realm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.62,1:01:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定会把你们扔进牢房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would see you in irons{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.55,1:01:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不敢招惹瑟兰迪尔国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before risking the wraith of king Thranduil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.38,1:01:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我打赌肯定有悄悄进城的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll wager there are ways to enter that town unseen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.92,1:01:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.49,1:01:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,但要有个走私贩帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But for that, you would need a smuggler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.42,1:02:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会付钱的 双倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For which we will pay, double.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.03,1:02:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,邪恶就是如此愚蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such is the nature of evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.09,1:02:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,即使遍布中土 依旧闭塞盲目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out there in the vast ignorance of the world it festers and spreads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.11,1:02:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,有阴影在黑暗中成长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A shadow that grows in the dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.46,1:02:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那恶灵昼夜不休\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A sleepless malice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.12,1:02:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,如夜幕一般黑暗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as black as the oncoming wall of night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.51,1:02:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,之前是这样 以后也永远会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it ever was. So will it always be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.47,1:02:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,最后 所有的邪恶都会现身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In time, all foul things come forth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.48,1:02:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在追杀13个矮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were tracking a company of 13 Dwarves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.56,1:02:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.59,1:02:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不是13个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not 13.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.42,1:02:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不再是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not any more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.50,1:02:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那个年轻人 黑头发的弓箭手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The young one, the black-haired archer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.54,1:02:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他中了魔窟的箭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We stuck him of a Morgul shaft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.23,1:02:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,毒液渗入血液 他活不长了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poison is in his blood, he'll be choking on it soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.39,1:03:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,回答问题 渣滓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Answer the question, filth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.58,1:03:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,最好别惹怒她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would not antagonize her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.99,1:03:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢杀戮吗 兽人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like killing things, Orc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.99,1:03:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢死亡吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.99,1:03:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那就让你尝尝死亡的滋味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then let me give it to you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.86,1:03:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在乎矮人的死活 回答我的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not care about one dead Dwarf. Answer the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.67,1:03:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么好害怕的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have nothing to fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.36,1:03:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,把知道的都说出来 我就放你自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell us what you know and I will set you free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.05,1:03:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,有人要杀死他们 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had orders to kill them, Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.53,1:03:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,索林·橡木盾对你们有什么用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is Thorin Oakenshield to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.02,1:03:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那个矮冬瓜永远别想当国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Dwarf runt will never be king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.43,1:03:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,国王吗 没有山下之王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}King? There's no King Under the Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.70,1:03:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,将来也不会有 只要那头龙还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nor will there ever be. None would they enter Erebor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.26,1:03:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,没人进得去艾雷博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whilst the dragon lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.73,1:04:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.52,1:04:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的世界将化为火海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your world will burn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.30,1:04:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.36,1:04:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,快说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.28,1:04:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的时代又回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our time has come again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.53,1:04:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我的主人效忠于他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My master serves the One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.19,1:04:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,现在明白了吧 精灵 死亡就要到来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand now, Elfling? Death is upon you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.13,1:04:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,战火就要蔓延到这了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The flames of war are upon you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.42,1:04:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.53,1:04:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过要放他自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You promised to set him free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.84,1:04:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我照做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.03,1:04:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我解放了他那卑鄙的头颅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I freed his wretched head from his miserable shoulders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.20,1:04:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这兽人嘴里还能套出话来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was more the Orc could tell us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.81,1:04:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得没什么价值了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was nothing more he could tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.84,1:04:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他说的战火是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he mean by the flames of war?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.03,1:04:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要使用什么武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means they intend to unleash a weapon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.80,1:04:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这武器强大到可以毁灭一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so great it will destroy all before it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.72,1:04:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,边境 道路和河流的守卫通通加倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want the watch doubled at our borders, all roads, all rivers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.14,1:04:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一有动静 立即禀报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing moves that I hear of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.30,1:05:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,严禁任何人进出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one enters this kingdom, and no one leaves it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.03,1:06:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.26,1:06:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你干什么 想淹死我们吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you trying to do? Drown us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.51,1:06:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这片水域生养了我 矮人老爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was born and bred on these waters , master Dwarf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.39,1:06:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就算我想淹死你们 也不会选这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I wanted to drown you, I would not do it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.53,1:06:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我受够这个长湖城的滑头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I've had enough of this slippy lake-man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.30,1:06:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,要我说直接丢掉他 甩了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say we throw him over the sail and then we dump him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.20,1:06:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,巴德 他叫巴德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bard, his name is Bard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.46,1:06:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.38,1:06:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我问的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, I asked him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.00,1:07:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不管他叫什么 我不喜欢他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care what he calls himself, I don't like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.03,1:07:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不需要喜欢他 付钱给他就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do not have to like him. We simply have to pay him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.57,1:07:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧伙计 钱都拿出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come now lads, turn out your pockets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.67,1:07:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎么知道他不会背叛我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we know he won't betray us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.60,1:07:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.98,1:07:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,还有个大问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's um, still a big problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.21,1:07:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,还差10枚银币\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're 10 coins short.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.88,1:07:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,葛罗音 快点 把你的钱拿出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gloin, come on. Give us what you have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.23,1:07:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,找我干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.96,1:07:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这次冒险弄得我倾家荡产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been bled dry by this venture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.06,1:07:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,一点回报都没见到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have I seen from my investment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.42,1:07:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有 只有痛苦和悲伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Naught but misery and grief and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.88,1:07:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,老天爷啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bless my beard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.49,1:07:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去 全都拿走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it, take all of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.28,1:07:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,钱呢 快点给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The money, quick, give it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.65,1:07:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,拿到供给之后自然会付你钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will pay you when we get our provisions,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.42,1:08:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,否则不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but not before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.15,1:08:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不想被关进大牢 就听我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you value your freedom, you'll do as I say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.18,1:08:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,前面有守卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are guards ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.84,1:08:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.79,1:08:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他在和什么人说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's talking to someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.19,1:08:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,还对着我们指指点点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's pointing right at us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.41,1:08:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,现在握起手来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now they're shaking hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.87,1:08:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.57,1:08:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这个坏人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The villain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.49,1:08:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他把我们卖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's selling us out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.85,1:09:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.86,1:09:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,马上到城门关了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're approaching the tollgate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.74,1:09:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,停船 货物检查 请出示文书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Halt. Goods inspection. Papers, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.44,1:09:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是你啊 巴德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's you, Bard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.78,1:09:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 珀西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning, Percy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.89,1:09:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么要申报的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything to declare?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.52,1:09:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 我又累又冷 想赶紧回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing, that I am cold and tired, and ready for home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.84,1:09:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and me both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.27,1:09:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,给你 没问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are, all in order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.81,1:09:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,别着急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not so fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.53,1:09:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,从林地王国托运回来的空木桶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consignment of empty barrels from the Woodland Realm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.78,1:09:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么不是空的呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only, they are not empty,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.10,1:09:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,巴德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are they, Bard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.44,1:09:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,没记错的话 你的执照是驳船工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I recall correctly. Your licensed as a bargeman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.09,1:10:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是渔夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a fisherman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.15,1:10:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不关你的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's none of your business!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.84,1:10:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,错了 这关城主的事 也就是我的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrong. It's the Master's business, which makes it my business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.82,1:10:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 埃弗雷德 讲点情理 城民等着吃饭呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on, Alfred, Have a heart. People need to eat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.82,1:10:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这些鱼是非法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These fish are illegal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.21,1:10:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把桶清空 - 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Empty the barrels over the side. - You heard him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.43,1:10:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,倒进河里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the canal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.09,1:10:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.32,1:10:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,镇上的人民在挨饿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Folks in this town are struggling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.63,1:10:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,日子艰难 食物又少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Times are hard, food is scarce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.23,1:10:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我有什么关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not my problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.91,1:10:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,如果人们听说城主把鱼扔进湖里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when the people hear their Master's dumping the fish in the lake,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.87,1:10:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,掀起暴动的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when the rioting starts,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.45,1:10:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你有关系了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will it be your problem, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.56,1:10:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.45,1:10:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,充当人民英雄吗 巴德 平民保护神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever the people's champion, aye, Bard? Protector of the common folk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.23,1:10:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不会一直支持你的 船夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might have their favor now, bargeman. But it won't last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.93,1:11:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,把门打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raise the gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.16,1:11:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了 城主盯着你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Master has his eye on you, you do well to remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.07,1:11:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道你住哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know where you live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.65,1:11:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,地方这么小 埃弗雷德 大家可都知根知底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a small town, Alfred. Everyone knows where everyone lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.70,1:11:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,外面的动静很大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All these talks of civil are unrest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.02,1:11:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在煽风点火 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's been stirring the pot, Sire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.17,1:11:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,痛风了吗 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gout playing ox, Sire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.63,1:11:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是潮气 肯定是潮气 给我弄点白兰地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the damp, it's the only possible explanation. Get me a brandy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.52,1:11:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,大人 民众的情绪让人不快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mood of the people, sire, is turning ugly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.37,1:11:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,平民就这样 埃弗雷德 让人不愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're commoners, Alfred. They've always been ugly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.81,1:11:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方到处是鱼腥臭气 又不怪我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not my fault that they live in a place that stinks of fish oil and tar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.91,1:11:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,工作 房屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jobs, shelter,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.72,1:12:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,食物 只有这点追求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}food, that's all they ever plead about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.03,1:12:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大人 肯定有人在幕后指使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is my belief, sire, that they've been led on by trouble makers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.80,1:12:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那就给我找出来 逮捕他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we must find these trouble makers, and arrest them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.80,1:12:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是这么想的 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My thoughts exactly, sire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.81,1:12:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,改革的言论给我压下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all these talks of change must be supressed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.36,1:12:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不能让造反的人聚在一起 制造言论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a fault to let the rebel banded together and start making noises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.07,1:12:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,搞不好他们还要问责 成立委员会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The next thing you know, they'll start asking questions, forming commities...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.20,1:12:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,发起调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}launching inquiries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.87,1:12:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,旧的不去 新的不来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out with the old, in with the new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.00,1:12:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.30,1:12:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直都在这么说 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I've been saying, sire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.60,1:12:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,还有传言说要选举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's even talk of election.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.78,1:12:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,选举 真荒唐 我绝不允许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Election? It's absurd. I won't stand for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.82,1:12:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不需要您允许吧 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think they'll ask you to stand, sire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.20,1:12:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这些强盗 忘恩负义 还想造反\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sackers, ingrates, rebel-rousers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.19,1:12:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,谁敢质疑我的权威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who would have the nerve to question my authority!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.77,1:12:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谁敢 谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who would dare? Who...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.18,1:13:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,巴德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.52,1:13:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对没错 幕后黑手就是这个船夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mark my words, that trouble-making bargeman is behind all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.29,1:13:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your hands off me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.57,1:13:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你没见过他们 他们没来过这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't see them. They were never here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.24,1:13:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,鱼送你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fish you can have for nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.87,1:13:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,跟上我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.92,1:13:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,爸 我们的房子被监视了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Da, our house, it's being watched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.86,1:14:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉城主我今天办完事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can tell the Master I'm done for the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.19,1:14:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Da.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.70,1:14:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where have you been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.94,1:14:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 你回来了 我好担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father, there you are! I was worried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.27,1:14:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好 贝恩 叫他们出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Bain, get them in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.36,1:14:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你跟别人说 我就把你的胳膊拧下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you speak of this to anyone. I'll rip your arms off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.48,1:14:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.13,1:14:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,在那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.28,1:15:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,爸 为什么有矮人从厕所里爬出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Da, why are the Dwarves climbing out from our toilet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.49,1:15:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他们能带来好运吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will they bring us luck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.09,1:15:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,可能不是很合身 但是保暖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They may not be the best fit, but they'll keep you warm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.04,1:15:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.19,1:15:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,矮人风弩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Dwarvish Windlass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.84,1:15:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你像是见了鬼魂一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look like you've seen a ghost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.46,1:15:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 上次见到这武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. The last time we saw such a weapon,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.34,1:15:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,河谷城化为了灰烬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a city was on fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.24,1:15:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那天巨龙袭来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was the day the dragon came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.05,1:15:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,史矛革摧毁了河谷城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The day that Smaug destroyed Dale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.07,1:15:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,城主吉利恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Girion, the Lord of the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.46,1:15:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,集结弓箭手射击巨龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rallied his bowman to fire upon the beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.74,1:16:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但龙皮无比坚固 牢不可破\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But a dragon's hide is tough. Tougher than the strongest armor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.60,1:16:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,只有风弩射出的黑箭能够刺穿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only a black arrow fired from a Windlass would pierce the dragon hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.53,1:16:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这种箭本就寥寥无几\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And few of those arrows were ever made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.01,1:16:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,吉利恩背水一战时 仅剩数支\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The store was running low when Girion made his last stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.48,1:16:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕他能射中一箭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had the aim of men been true that day...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.36,1:16:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,也不会落到这步田地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}much would've been different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.21,1:16:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你当时在场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You speak as if you were there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.70,1:16:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,所有矮人都知道这个故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All Dwarves know the tale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.91,1:16:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那你应该知道吉利恩击中了巨龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you would know that Girion hit the dragon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.51,1:16:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,射落了左翼的一块鳞片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It loosened the scale on the left wing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.27,1:16:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,再补一箭就能杀死那怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one more shot he would have killed the beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.84,1:16:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不过是童话而已 孩子 只是童话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's fairy story, lad. Nothing more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.36,1:16:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你收了钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You took all our money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.82,1:17:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,武器在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are the weapons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.60,1:17:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,等着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.37,1:17:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,明天是最后一个秋日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow begins our last day of autumn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.48,1:17:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,后天便是杜林之日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Durin's day falls the morning after next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.94,1:17:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,必须在那之前赶到孤山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must reach the mountain before then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.15,1:17:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不能呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if we do not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.57,1:17:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,如果那之前找不到隐秘之门呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we fail to find the hidden door before that time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.40,1:17:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那计划就全落空了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then this quest has been for nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.42,1:17:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.95,1:17:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,钩矛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pike hook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.69,1:17:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,旧鱼叉改的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Made from an old harpoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.37,1:17:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这个呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.12,1:17:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们叫它鹤嘴锄 改进过的铁匠锤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A crowbill, we call it. Expansion from smittys hammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.24,1:17:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然上手很重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's heavy in hand, I grant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.83,1:17:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但需要保命时 也能凑合着用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in defense of your life, these will serve you better than none.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.33,1:18:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们买的是武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We paid you for weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.08,1:18:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,铁铸黑鞘的宝剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Iron forged, swords of dark sheath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.38,1:18:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这是开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a joke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.48,1:18:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这是军械库外最好的武器了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't find better outside the city armory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.14,1:18:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,铁铸的兵器都锁在军械库里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All iron-forged weapons are held there and locked in key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.86,1:18:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.86,1:18:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着这些走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not take his offer and go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.07,1:18:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,更差的兵器我都用过 你不也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've made do with less. So have you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.13,1:18:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在就走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say we leave now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.42,1:18:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你们哪都不能去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.21,1:18:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.27,1:18:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,全城的眼线 乃至狼狗都盯着这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are spies watching this house and probably every wolf and dog in town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.22,1:18:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,必须等到傍晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must wait until nightfall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.26,1:18:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.53,1:19:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Da?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.65,1:19:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,别让他们出门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let them leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.50,1:19:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不要一个人追杀30个兽人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can not hunt 30 orcs on your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.63,1:19:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,可我不是一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm not on my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.30,1:19:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我要跟来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew I would come?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.29,1:19:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,国王很愤怒 塔睿尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The king is angry, Tauriel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.39,1:19:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,600年来 我父亲一直保护你 宠爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For 600 years, my father has protected you, favored you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.24,1:19:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你却违抗了他的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You defied his orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.54,1:20:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,辜负了他的信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You betrayed his trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.35,1:20:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,国王从未准许兽人入境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The king has never let Orcs fill from outlands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.12,1:20:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这次却纵容他们穿越边境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he would let this Orc pack cross our borders{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.23,1:20:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,追杀我们的犯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and kill our prisoners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.82,1:20:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们不该插手 - 怎么不该插手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It is not our fight. - It is our fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.44,1:20:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不会善罢甘休 这是在助长邪恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will not end here. With every victory this evil will grow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.43,1:20:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你父亲一意孤行 我们袖手旁观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If your father has his way, we would do nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.40,1:20:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能躲在城墙后 不见天日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will hide within our walls, live our lives away from light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.39,1:20:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,任由黑暗侵袭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And let the darkness descend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.74,1:20:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是中土世界的一员吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we not a part of this world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.87,1:20:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友 怎么能让邪恶力量比我们强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me mellon, when did we let evil become stronger than us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.67,1:20:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 巴德 你在找什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Bard. What you after?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.33,1:20:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,有一条旧挂毯 上哪去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a tapestry, an old one. Where has it gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.61,1:20:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,什么旧挂毯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What tapestry are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.68,1:21:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.20,1:21:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉你 他们是矮人 凭空出现的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were Dwarves, I tell you. Appeared out of nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.21,1:21:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,满脸胡子 眯缝眼 从来没见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full-beards, pierced eyes. I've never seen the like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.41,1:21:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,矮人在这做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are Dwarves doing in these parts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.72,1:21:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是预言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the prophecy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.96,1:21:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 预言 - 杜林后人的预言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Prophecy? - Prophecy of Durin's folk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.89,1:21:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,预言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prophecy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.93,1:21:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,预言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prophecy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.12,1:21:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那些传说可能成真了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The old tales may come true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.96,1:21:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大笔财宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vast hordes of treasure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.37,1:21:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can it really be true?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.83,1:21:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,银泉之主回归了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has the Lord of the silver fountains returned?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.98,1:21:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,银泉之主 刻石之王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lord of the silver fountains. The king of carven stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.92,1:21:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,山下之王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The King Beneath the Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.90,1:21:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,将重回宝座\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall come into his own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.18,1:21:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,人民欢庆山下之王的回归\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the bell shall ring in gladness at the Mountain King's return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.02,1:22:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但一切必以悲剧收场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But all shall fail in sadness,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.21,1:22:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,湖水闪耀 战火重燃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the lake will shine and burn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.37,1:22:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸 我想阻止他们 - 他们走了多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Da, I tried to stopped them... - How long have they been gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.67,1:22:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,拿到武器 直接去孤山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As soon we have the weapons we make straight for the Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.64,1:22:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.96,1:22:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.31,1:22:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,撑得住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can manage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.44,1:22:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们赶紧走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.27,1:22:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.30,1:23:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is the meaning of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.86,1:23:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,抓到他们在偷武器 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We caught them stealing weapon, sire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.53,1:23:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这是全民公敌呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enemies of the state, em?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.81,1:23:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,看样子是群下贱的佣兵 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A disgrace bunch of mercenaries, if ever there were, Sire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.08,1:23:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,住嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your tongue!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.11,1:23:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道你在跟谁讲话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do not know to whom you speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.79,1:23:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这哪是什么犯罪 他是索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is no common criminal! This is Thorin,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.47,1:23:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,瑟罗尔的后人 瑟莱因之子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}son of Thrain, son of Thror!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.74,1:23:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是艾雷博的矮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are the Dwarves of Erebor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.55,1:24:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来收复故土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have come to reclaim our homeland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.48,1:24:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我还记得这镇子昔日的辉煌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember this town in the great days of old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.71,1:24:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,码头停满了船舶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fleets of boats laid at the harbor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.79,1:24:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,满载丝绸和珠宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}filled with silks and fine gems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.56,1:24:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这里不是被人遗忘的湖边小城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was no forsaken town on a lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.40,1:24:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这里曾是北方的贸易中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was the center of all trade of the North.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.94,1:24:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我要重现往日的辉煌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would see those days return,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.03,1:24:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,点亮矮人的熔炉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would relive the great forges of Dwarves,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.67,1:24:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,让艾雷博的商队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}send wealth and riches flowing once more...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.52,1:24:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,载满财富接踵而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the hordes of Erebor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.62,1:24:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你只会带来死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death, that is what you will bring upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.58,1:24:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,龙火和毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dragon fire and ruin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.72,1:24:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,吵醒了那怪物 我们就全完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you awaken that beast, it will destroy us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.01,1:24:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你们可以听他劝阻 不过我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can listen to this nay-sayer, but I promise you this:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.16,1:24:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,如果成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we succeed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.02,1:25:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,孤山的财富大家可以一起分享\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all will share in the wealth of the Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.99,1:25:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,到手的财富 可以让十个埃加洛斯重现辉煌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will have enough gold, to rebuild Esgaroth 10 times over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.32,1:25:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人 听我说 听好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of you, listen to me! You must listen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.23,1:25:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你们忘记河谷城的事了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you forgotten what happened in Dale?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.25,1:25:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,忘记葬身火海的百姓了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you forgotten of those who died in firestorm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.51,1:25:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,都是为了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for what purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.16,1:25:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,为了山下之王盲目的野心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blind ambition of a Mountain King.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.66,1:25:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,贪婪蒙蔽了他的双眼 他心里只有欲望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So riven by greed, he can not see beyond his own desire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.00,1:25:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,等一等 我们每个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. We must not, any of us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.07,1:25:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,都不要急着横加指责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}be too quick to lay blame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.52,1:25:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不要忘了 吉利恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us not forget, that it was Girion,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.86,1:25:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,河谷城主 你的先人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord of Dale, your ancestor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.27,1:25:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,没能杀死那怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who failed to kill the beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.26,1:25:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 大人 我们都知道这个故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's true, sire. We all know the story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.57,1:26:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他射了一箭又一箭 却全部射偏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arrow after arrow he shot, each one missing its mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.46,1:26:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你无权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no right,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.41,1:26:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,无权进入孤山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no right to enter that mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.23,1:26:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我有权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have the only right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.49,1:26:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,请问长湖城主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I speak to the Master of the men of the lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.79,1:26:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,您愿意见证预言成真吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you see the prophecy fulfilled?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.09,1:26:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.63,1:26:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,分享我们的无尽财富吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}share in the great wealth of our people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.21,1:26:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,您怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What say you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.51,1:26:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我要说 欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say unto you, welcome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.65,1:27:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,请平身 欢迎山下之王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome and rise! Welcome, King under the mountain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.75,1:27:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我们少一个人吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do know we have one short?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.44,1:27:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 比弗在哪 - 他不在也不要管他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Bifur? - He's not here, we leave him behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.09,1:27:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,想在日落前找到门 只能这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll have to, if you were to find the door before nightfall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.26,1:27:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们拖不起了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can risk no more delays.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.46,1:27:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.99,1:27:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,今天要全力赶路 你会拖慢我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must travel with speed. You'll slow us down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.69,1:27:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么呢 我要跟你们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about? I'm coming with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.37,1:27:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.68,1:27:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,舅舅 我一定要看着那门打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle, I must be there when that door is open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.16,1:27:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定要一起仰望先祖的大厅 索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we first look upon the halls of our fathers, Thorin...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.50,1:27:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,奇力 留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kili, stay here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.32,1:27:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,休息 痊愈后来找我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}rest, join us when you're healed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.41,1:27:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我来陪这孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll stay with the lad{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.85,1:27:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我的职责就是照顾伤员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my duty lies with the wounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.89,1:28:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,舅舅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.75,1:28:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是听着孤山的故事长大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We grew up with the tales of the Mountain, tales you told us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.14,1:28:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不要剥夺他的梦想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't take that away from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.67,1:28:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 奇力 - 我可以背着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kili. - I will carry him if I must!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.16,1:28:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,等你坐上王位 就能理解了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day you will be king and you will understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.12,1:28:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不能因为一个矮人耽搁了远征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot risk the fate of this quest for the sake of one Dwarf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.75,1:28:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕是我的亲人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not even my own kin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.12,1:28:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,菲力 别犯傻 你跟大家在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fili, don't be a fool. You belong with the company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.29,1:28:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我要和弟弟在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I belong with my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.35,1:28:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,难道要出发了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By my beard, is that the time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.24,1:28:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你们好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good fortune to all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.75,1:29:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.19,1:29:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.29,1:29:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你们也错过开船了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you miss the boarders as well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.96,1:29:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,奇力 奇力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kili, Kili!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.82,1:29:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我受够矮人了 走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I'm done with Dwarves, go away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.01,1:29:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,别 别 别 没人肯帮我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. No one will help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.18,1:29:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,奇力病了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kili's sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.11,1:29:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是重病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's very sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.45,1:30:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这是哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.32,1:30:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经的河谷城 现在只是一片废墟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For once the city of Dale. Now it is a ruin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.04,1:30:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,史矛革留下的荒原\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The desolation of Smaug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.63,1:30:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,马上到正午了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sun will soon reach midday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.75,1:30:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,必须在日落前找到进入孤山的隐秘之门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must find the hidden door into the Mountain before it sets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.16,1:30:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这边 - 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This way. - Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.72,1:30:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是瞭望角吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this the overlook?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.71,1:30:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫说无论如何 都要在这等...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf said to meet him here on no account of what you hear or...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.92,1:30:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你见到他了吗 来不及等他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you see him? We have no time to wait upon a wizard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.07,1:30:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能靠自己了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.14,1:30:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.99,1:31:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,多尔戈多 巫师之山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dol Guldur, the hill of sorcerer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.33,1:31:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,看样子废弃已久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks completely abandoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.83,1:31:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,像是故意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As it is meant to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.48,1:31:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这是障眼法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A spell of concealment lies over this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.59,1:31:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人应该不想现出真身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which means our enemies are not yet ready to reveal himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.41,1:31:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他还没恢复元气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has not regained his full strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.29,1:31:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞达加斯特 给盖拉德丽尔女王送个信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Radagast, I need you to carry a message to the Lady Galadriel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.72,1:31:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉她 要逼他行动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell her, we must force his hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.28,1:31:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.30,1:31:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我独自进去 千万不要跟着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going in alone. On no account come after me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.19,1:31:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你保证吗 - 保证 保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do I have your word? - Yes, yes, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.30,1:31:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 甘道夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.93,1:31:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是个陷阱呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if it's a trap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.72,1:32:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,转过身去 不要回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn around and do not come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.53,1:32:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定是陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's undoubtly a trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.95,1:33:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,藏身于此的恶灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cé ná ulco sís nurtaina...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.35,1:33:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,速速现身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ettuluvas caninye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.29,1:33:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 找到了吗 - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Anything? - Nothing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.75,1:33:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,如果地图没问题 隐秘之门应该就在头顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the map is true, the hidden door is hidden right above us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.94,1:33:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.98,1:34:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你眼神真锐利 巴金斯大师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have keen eyes, Master Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.24,1:34:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定是这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This must be it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.51,1:34:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,隐秘之门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hidden door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.01,1:34:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那些质疑我们的人 后悔去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That all those who doubted us, rue this day!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.20,1:34:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, we have a key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.43,1:35:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所以应该有个锁孔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This means that somewhere, there is a keyhole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.10,1:35:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,杜林之日 落日余晖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last light of Durin's Day...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.19,1:35:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,锁孔即现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will shine upon the keyhole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.39,1:35:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳要下山了 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're losing the light, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.79,1:35:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,别乱踢 我听不到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be quiet! We can't hear when you're thumping!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.55,1:35:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,找不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.93,1:35:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.15,1:35:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.03,1:35:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,砸开它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wreck it down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.32,1:35:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.89,1:35:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定能打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has to break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.38,1:35:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,没用 门锁上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's no good, the door is sealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.13,1:35:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不能用蛮力打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't be opened by force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.31,1:35:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,有强力的魔法保护着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is powerful magic on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.65,1:36:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.19,1:36:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,杜林之日 落日余晖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last light of Durin's Day...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.41,1:36:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,锁孔即现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will shine upon the keyhole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.37,1:36:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That what it says.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.49,1:36:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们少了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did we miss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.89,1:36:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们少了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did we miss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.51,1:36:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 巴林 - 没有太阳光了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Balin. - We've lost the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.22,1:36:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没有办法了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no more to be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.56,1:36:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只有那一次机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have but one chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.11,1:36:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,过来吧 小伙子们 结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come over here, lads. It's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.43,1:36:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 怎么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute, what...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.13,1:37:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他们去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.31,1:37:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么能现在放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't give up now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.06,1:37:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.27,1:37:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不能现在放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't give up now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.37,1:37:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,画眉击门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last light, the grey stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.78,1:37:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,倚灰岩立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the thrush nods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.71,1:37:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,杜林之日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The setting sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.37,1:37:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,落日余晖 锁孔即现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the last light of Durin's Day will shine...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.49,1:37:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,落日余晖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.42,1:37:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,余晖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.45,1:38:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是余晖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the last light...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.97,1:38:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,锁眼在那 回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The keyhole! Come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.09,1:38:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,回来 是月光 最后一轮秋月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come back! It's the moon! The last moon of autumn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.52,1:39:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙呢 钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the key, where's the key? Where's the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.61,1:39:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就在 附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was...here. It was here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.88,1:39:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.87,1:40:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,艾雷博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Erebor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.00,1:40:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.42,1:40:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我认得这墙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.20,1:40:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这墙壁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These walls...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.71,1:40:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这岩石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.27,1:40:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,记得吗 巴林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember, Balin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.64,1:40:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,耀满金光的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chambers filled with golden light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.99,1:40:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.82,1:41:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,此下即是杜林后人的七代王国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Herein lies the seventh kingdom of Durin's folk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.70,1:41:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,愿崇山之心团结中土矮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May the Heart of the Mountain unite all Dwarves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.98,1:41:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,保卫家园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in defense of this home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.27,1:41:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,矮人王座\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The throne of the king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.89,1:41:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,再上面呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what's that above it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.73,1:41:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,阿肯宝钻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Arkenstone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.77,1:41:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,阿肯宝钻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arkenstone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.12,1:41:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是什么 - 那个 盗贼大师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And what's that? - That, master burglar...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.75,1:41:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是你此行的使命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is why you are here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.77,1:42:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 做点什么啊 - 我需要草药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you not do something? - I need herbs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.14,1:42:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,能退烧的草药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something to bring down this fever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.96,1:42:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,有龙葵 解热草\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have nightshade, fever fuel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.69,1:42:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,没用 王叶草有吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're no use to me. Do you have any kingsfoil?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.40,1:42:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 那是杂草 喂猪用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's a weed. We feed it to the pigs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.17,1:42:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,喂猪 杂草 对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pigs? Weed, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.52,1:42:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.54,1:42:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要我去找宝钻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want me to find the jewel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.68,1:42:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,白色的 大钻石 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A large white jewel, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.63,1:42:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,又白又大吗 底下应该不少吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it? Only I imagine there's quite a few down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.42,1:42:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,阿肯宝钻是独一无二的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is only one Arkenstone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.19,1:42:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你一眼就能认出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll know it when you see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.37,1:42:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.30,1:42:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,实话说 孩子 我也不知道底下有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In truth, lad. I do not know what you'll find down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.29,1:43:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想去可以不去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You needn't go if you don't want to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.43,1:43:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放弃也没什么丢脸的 - 不 巴林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's no dishonor in turning back. - No, Balin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.95,1:43:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,既然我承诺了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promised I would do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.58,1:43:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,至少要努力一把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I think I must try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.05,1:43:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你总是不断给我惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never ceases to amaze me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.02,1:43:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么意思 - 霍比特人的勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's that? - The courage of Hobbits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.11,1:43:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧 衷心祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go now, with as much luck as you can muster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.14,1:43:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 比尔博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh...Bilbo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.75,1:43:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,底下要是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there's in fact a, um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.60,1:43:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,真有火龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a live dragon down here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.72,1:43:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,别吵醒它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't wake it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.80,1:44:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,藏身于此的恶灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cé ná ulco sís nurtaina...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.10,1:44:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,速速现身 现出原形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ettuluvas caninye! Cánin i sá tanuvaxe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.89,1:45:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你的主人在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is your master?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.99,1:45:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.84,1:47:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,索隆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sauron!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.06,1:47:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.29,1:48:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,记住 这不是家里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not at home. Not at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.11,1:48:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,要是 好吧好吧好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if...good, good, good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.20,1:49:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是这个吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.94,1:49:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,阿肯宝钻 阿肯宝钻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arkenstone, Arkenstone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.42,1:49:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,又大又白的钻石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A large white jewel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.51,1:49:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真是谢谢你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very helpful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.66,1:52:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,小偷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, thief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.92,1:52:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我闻得到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I smell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.88,1:52:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,也听得到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear your breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.40,1:52:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,还感觉得到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel your air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.21,1:52:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.09,1:52:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.37,1:52:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,别害羞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come now, don't be shy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.48,1:52:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,现身吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand into the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.71,1:53:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,有些不对劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is something about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.27,1:53:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你带着什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something you carry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.28,1:53:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是金子做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something made of gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.91,1:53:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,却比金子珍贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But far more precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.17,1:53:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,在这呀 躲躲藏藏的小偷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you are, a thief in the shadows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.21,1:53:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我没想偷东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did not come to steal from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.98,1:53:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,无比富有的史矛革\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O Smaug, the unassessably wealthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.63,1:53:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想亲眼目睹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I merely want to get eyes upon your magnificence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.46,1:53:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,传说中伟岸的巨龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To see if you really were as great as the old tales say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.99,1:53:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我原来不相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did not believe them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.91,1:53:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,现在信了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And do you now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.19,1:53:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,信了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Truly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.74,1:54:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,传说和歌谣里的描述\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tales and songs...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.89,1:54:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,在你一比真是相形见绌 庞然大物史矛革\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fall utterly short, of your enormity, O Smaug the stupendous!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.68,1:54:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得奉承我能活命吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think flattery will keep you alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.68,1:54:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.66,1:54:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.54,1:54:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你好像认识我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem familiar with my name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.00,1:54:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我却不记得你的气味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I don't remember smelling your kind before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.14,1:54:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁 哪里来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you? And where do you come from...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.35,1:54:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,请问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}may I ask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.69,1:54:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.45,1:54:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我来自山下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came from under the hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.39,1:54:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,山下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Under hill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.62,1:54:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我翻山越岭 跋山涉水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And under hills and over hills, my path is lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.62,1:54:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,来去无踪的我 穿梭到了这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, and through the air. I am here that He walks unseen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.83,1:55:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,厉害 你还有什么名号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impressive, what else do you claim to be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.71,1:55:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.85,1:55:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好运随身的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}luck-wearer...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.85,1:55:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 猜谜能手 - 好名号 继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Riddle-maker. - Lovely titles, go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.96,1:55:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 酒桶骑士 - 酒桶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Barrel-rider. - Barrels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.77,1:55:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,有点意思了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that is interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:20.14,1:55:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你的矮人朋友呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what about your little Dwarf friends?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.01,1:55:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,都躲在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they hiding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.59,1:55:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,矮人 没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}D...dwarves? No...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.47,1:55:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,哪有什么矮人 你弄错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no Dwarves here. You got that all wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.55,1:55:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我不信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.56,1:55:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,酒桶骑士 他们叫你来送死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barrel-rider, they sent you in here to do their dirty work,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.93,1:55:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,自己在外面做缩头乌龟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while they skulk about outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.88,1:55:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Truly. You are mistaken...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.70,1:55:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,伟大的史矛革 猛兽之王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O Smaug, chiefest and greatest of all calamities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.46,1:56:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,别看你偷东西还撒谎 倒是很有礼貌呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have nice manners for a thief and a liar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.26,1:56:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我熟悉矮人的气味和味道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the smell and taste of Dwarf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.44,1:56:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,无比熟悉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.95,1:56:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是为了金子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.82,1:56:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他们对黄金趋之若鹜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are drawn to treasure like flies to dead flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.42,1:56:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我不知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you think I did not know this day would come?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.45,1:56:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我早料到这群虚伪小人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That a pack of canting dogs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.52,1:56:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,会偷偷潜回孤山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will come crawling back to the Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.30,1:56:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 地震吗 - 孩子 这动静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Was that an earthquake? - That, my lad...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.94,1:56:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was a dragon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.93,1:56:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸 - 山那边来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Da? - It's come from the mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.57,1:57:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,别管我们了 带着孩子逃吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should leave us. Take your children, get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.41,1:57:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,逃去哪里 无处可逃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And go where? There is nowhere to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.19,1:57:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们会死吗 爸 - 不会 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are we going to die, da? - No, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.16,1:57:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,火龙会杀掉我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dragon is going to kill us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.18,1:57:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我会先杀掉它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if I kill it first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.63,1:57:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,山下之王已死 他的王位在我脚下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The King Under the Mountain is dead. I took his throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.49,1:57:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他的子民是我的点心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ate his people like a wolf among sheep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.13,1:57:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我肆意杀戮 随心所欲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I kill where I wish, when I wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.25,1:57:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我的鳞甲坚如钢铁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My armor is iron!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.86,1:58:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,坚不可摧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No blade can pierce me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.32,1:58:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 安全 - 黑箭 你怎么不早说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right. - A black arrow. Why did you never tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.37,1:58:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,因为没必要告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you did not need to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.53,1:58:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好好听我说 你去引开警卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me carefully. I need you to distract the guards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.08,1:58:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我得上塔 将箭上弦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once I'm at the top of the tower, I will set the arrow to the bow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.55,1:58:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他在这 - 卫兵 抓住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There he is. - Guards, after him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.71,1:58:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,快 那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quickly, down there! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.75,1:58:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.07,1:58:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,贝恩 贝恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bain, Bain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.57,1:58:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,藏好 不能让别人发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep it safe, don't let anyone find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.73,1:58:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我来对付他们 去吧 - 我不走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll deal with them. Now go! - I'm not leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.24,1:58:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拉加 - 你被捕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ragar. - You're under arrest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.89,1:59:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么罪名 - 那要听城主的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- On what charge? - Any charge the Master chooses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:45.51,1:59:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 比尔博怎么办 - 再给他点时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about Bilbo? - Give him more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.13,1:59:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,给他时间干嘛 送死吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to do what? To be killed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.66,1:59:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怕了 - 我是怕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're afraid. - Yes, I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.98,2:00:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我替你担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fear for you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.58,2:00:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,怕那宝藏迷人心智的魔力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the sickness the lies upon that treasure,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.16,2:00:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那害你祖父癫狂的恶疾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a sickness which drove your grandfather mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.69,2:00:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是我祖父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not my grandfather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.68,2:00:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你也不是你自己了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.16,2:00:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我认识的索林从不畏缩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Thorin I know would not hesitate to go in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.46,2:00:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不能因为一个盗贼耽误了远征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not risk this quest for the life of one burglar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.21,2:00:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他有名字 叫比尔博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bilbo, his name is Bilbo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.83,2:00:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是橡木盾 妄图篡权的卑鄙小人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Oakenshield, that filthy Dwarvish usurper!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.86,2:00:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他派你来偷阿肯宝钻 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He sent you here for the Arkenstone, didn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.61,2:00:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.89,2:00:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what you're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.26,2:00:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不用否认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't bother denying it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.32,2:00:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我早看出他的祸心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guessed his foul purpose some time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.35,2:00:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但无所谓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it matters not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:53.11,2:00:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,橡木盾的远征注定要失败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oakenshield's quest will fail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.33,2:01:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,黑暗到来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A darkness is coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.94,2:01:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,蔓延到了中土的每个角落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was spread to every corner of the land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:47.48,2:01:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你被利用了 躲躲藏藏的小偷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are being used, thief in the shadows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.18,2:01:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是他们手里的工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are only ever a means to an end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.66,2:01:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,橡木盾那个胆小鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The coward Oakenshield has weighed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.99,2:02:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,根本没把你的小命当回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the value of your life, and found it worth nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:03.75,2:02:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.76,2:02:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你骗人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you're lying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.97,2:02:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他怎么许诺的 要分你些财宝吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he promise you, a share of the treasure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.66,2:02:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好像财宝是他的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As if it was his to give.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.93,2:02:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你一枚金币都不许带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not part with a single coin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.33,2:02:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不许带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not one piece of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.10,2:02:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我的利齿是宝剑 尖爪是长矛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My teeth are swords, my claws are spears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.70,2:02:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,双翼一挥 暴风来袭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My wings, are a hurricane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.73,2:02:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,传说是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it is true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.86,2:02:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 黑箭射中了你 - 你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The black arrow found its mark. - What did you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.07,2:02:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么 您果然名不虚传\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing. I was just saying your reputation proceeds you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.89,2:02:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,暴君史矛革\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O Smaug the Tyrannical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.78,2:03:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,您真的是无可比拟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Truly, you have no equal on this earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.77,2:03:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我差点动心 让你拿走宝钻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm almost tempted to let you take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:09.94,2:03:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好让橡木盾受折磨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If only to see Oakenshield suffer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.62,2:03:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,看他走向毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it destroy him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.89,2:03:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,看他荒废自己 日渐癫狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it corrupt his arms, and drive him mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.32,2:03:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不过算了 就陪你玩到这吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I think not, I think our little game ends here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.46,2:03:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,说吧 小偷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So tell me, thief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.64,2:03:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你想怎么死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you choose to die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:50.52,2:04:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,爸 是你吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Da? Is that you, Da?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.10,2:07:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.54,2:07:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,外面还有 塔睿尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are others, Tauriel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:09.50,2:07:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:14.68,2:07:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他要死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're losing him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.58,2:07:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,塔睿尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tauriel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.64,2:07:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,艾瑟拉斯(王叶草)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Athelas.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.59,2:07:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,艾瑟拉斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Athelas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:51.06,2:07:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你要干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.02,2:07:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,救他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to save him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.74,2:08:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没死 - 活不久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're alive. - Not for much longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:19.12,2:08:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 阿肯宝钻呢 - 火龙要来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you find the Arkenstone? - The dragon's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.95,2:08:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,阿肯宝钻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Arkenstone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.99,2:08:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you find it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.49,2:08:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,快走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.94,2:08:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:41.56,2:08:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:13.22,2:09:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,化为灰烬吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will burn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.51,2:09:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跑 - 快跑 比尔博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - Come on, Bilbo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:38.54,2:09:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:56.49,2:09:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,按住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:05.87,2:10:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,愿星月之光眷顾你 赐你生机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Menno o nin na hon i eliad annen annin hon leitho o-ngurth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:14.83,2:10:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,蒂尔达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tilda!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:16.77,2:10:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,愿星月之光眷顾你 赐你生机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Menno o nin na hon i eliad annen annin hon leitho o-ngurth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:28.87,2:10:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,愿星月之光眷顾你 赐你生机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Menno o nin na hon i eliad annen annin hon leitho o-ngurth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:35.53,2:10:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,愿星月之光眷顾你 赐你生机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Menno o nin na hon i eliad annen annin hon leitho o-ngurth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:47.93,2:10:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,愿星月之光眷顾你 赐你生机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Menno o nin na hon i eliad annen annin hon leitho o-ngurth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:18.02,2:11:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们甩掉它了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have given him the slip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:19.55,2:11:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他会追上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he'll still come in for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:24.95,2:11:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在去哪 - 西边的卫队室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So where to now? - Western guard room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:28.76,2:11:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 或许能出去 - 太高了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There may be a way out. - It's too high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:32.13,2:11:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没可能的 - 只有这条路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No chance that way. - It's our only chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:36.19,2:11:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得赌一把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to try it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:42.87,2:12:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我只听过精灵疗伤的传说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've heard tales of wonders of Elvish medicine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:46.86,2:12:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,亲眼见到真是荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a privilege to witness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.12,2:12:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,塔睿尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tauriel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:57.46,2:12:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,躺好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lie still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:06.05,2:13:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot be her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:11.54,2:13:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,她在远方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's far away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:17.92,2:13:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,在遥不可及的远方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is far, far away from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:22.78,2:13:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,她走在天上的星光里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She walks in starlight in another world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:33.19,2:13:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜只是个梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:46.98,2:13:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得她会爱上我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think she could have loved me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:56.12,2:13:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,跟紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:07.86,2:14:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 完了 - 没路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's it, then. - There's no way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:18.16,2:14:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,最后的族人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last of our kin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:24.10,2:14:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,绝处逢生的希望 成了泡影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must have come here, hoping beyond hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:39.00,2:14:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,回矿山看看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can try to reach the mines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:42.20,2:14:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,在生命最后的时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My last few days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:46.47,2:14:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:50.62,2:14:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要这样死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not die like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:54.19,2:14:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,畏缩不前 苟延残喘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cowering, clawing for breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:02.83,2:15:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们去熔炉 - 会被发现的 死路一条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We make for the forges. - He'll see us, sure as death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:06.44,2:15:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,分头行动就不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if we split up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:07.90,2:15:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,索林 我们到不了的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin, we'll never make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:10.88,2:15:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,总有人能到 引他去熔炉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of us might, lead him to the forges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:16.02,2:15:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要屠龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We kill the dragon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:19.59,2:15:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是死路一条 也是同生共死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this is to end in fire, then we will all burn together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:26.12,2:15:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:31.88,2:15:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,逃命 逃命去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flee, flee, run for your lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:37.96,2:15:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然无处可逃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is nowhere to hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:42.52,2:15:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,看后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behind you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:45.22,2:15:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:48.35,2:15:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:50.89,2:15:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,在这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey you! Here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:51.54,2:18:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, it's this way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:53.67,2:18:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这边 - 索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - Thorin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:01.41,2:19:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,跟巴林走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow Balin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:03.91,2:19:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 索林 - 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thorin! - Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:20.84,2:19:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:31.52,2:19:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:06.12,2:20:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:10.23,2:20:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:15.68,2:20:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,行不通 熔炉早就冷却了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our plan's not gonna work. These furnaces are stone-cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:19.53,2:20:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,确实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:20.58,2:20:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,没有大火 没法点燃熔炉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With no fire hot enough to set them ablaze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:26.03,2:20:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,没有吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have we not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:28.97,2:20:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到赢你这么容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did not look to see you so easily outwitted!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:35.85,2:20:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你变慢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're growing slow,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:37.73,2:20:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,变胖了 老不死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and fat, you dotage,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:42.79,2:20:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,糊涂虫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}slug!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:45.49,2:20:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,躲起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take cover!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:14.63,2:21:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,邦伯 拉动风箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bombur, get those bellows working!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:17.05,2:21:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:32.29,2:21:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔博 去操纵杆那 等我信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bilbo! Up there! On my mark, pull that lever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:46.76,2:21:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,巴林 能弄些炸弹吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balin, can you still make us a blast flame?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:49.24,2:21:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,行 一小会就弄好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, it'll only take a jiffy. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:53.49,2:21:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,一小会也等不及啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have a jiffy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:06.87,2:22:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 硫磺呢 - 你真的会做吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's the sulphur? - You sure you know what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:21.89,2:22:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,速度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:44.93,2:22:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:42.37,2:24:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,引它去历代君王的画像那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lead him to the gallery of the kings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:32.48,2:25:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,别停下 比尔博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep going, Bilbo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:20.49,2:26:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为你骗得了我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, think you can deceive me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:23.44,2:26:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,酒桶骑士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barrel-rider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:27.25,2:26:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你是从长湖城来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have come from Lake-town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:31.66,2:26:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这群肮脏的矮人 和运河上的生意人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is some sort of schemes hatched between these filthy Dwarves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:37.12,2:26:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,悲哀的长湖城人一起密谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and those miserable tub-trading lakeman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:41.10,2:26:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,只知道射黑箭的胆小鬼们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sniveling cowards, with their long bows and black arrows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:48.22,2:26:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是不是该会会他们 - 糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Perhaps it is time I pay them a visit. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:55.95,2:27:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这和他们无关 别去长湖城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't their fault. Wait, you cannot go to Lake-town!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:02.38,2:27:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你在乎他们 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You care about them, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:06.92,2:27:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:08.48,2:27:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那就看着他们化为灰烬吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you can watch them die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:16.31,2:27:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这 笨虫子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here! You witless worm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:26.03,2:27:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你 - 新帐旧账一起算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You. - I am taking back what you stole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:34.65,2:27:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你斗不过我的 矮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will take nothing from me, Dwarf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:40.84,2:27:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,旧日的矮人勇士都倒在我脚下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I laid low your warriors of old,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:45.86,2:27:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,吓得魂不附体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}eye in still terror in the hearts of men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:51.56,2:27:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我才是山下之王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am King Under the Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:57.41,2:28:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这王国不属于你 这是矮人之国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not your kingdom, these are Dwarf lands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:02.64,2:28:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,矮人的黄金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Dwarf gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:05.96,2:28:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,看矮人怎么复仇吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we will have our revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:30.06,2:29:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我会复仇的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will revenge, revenge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:35.72,2:29:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去复仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will show you revenge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:17.24,2:30:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 你不知道什么来了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me, you don't know what is coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:23.60,2:30:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是烈焰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:28.37,2:30:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:33.02,2:30:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:43.18,2:30:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都干了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have we done?{\r}
